    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Supplies the I/O shell that specs 003, 004, and 006 describe but the workspace did not contain: the wire-witness executable, a per-attempt loopback listener, a fresh in-memory CA, exact-allowlist TLS interception, an HTTP/1.1 relay that forwards verbatim and observes within bounds, redacted exchange records, and a capture manifest. It names every protocol and retention path it does not yet implement and refuses or reports them.\n",
